  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656428",
      "title": "Adding Editing Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 489,
      "videoOrder": 450,
      "sourceHash": "bffbe9aef4f9e1d436c09fe89d7cb60a13d5edcd6e6ebc601f33341a1153dcf5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "Instructor: So with child routing almost finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 7.56,
          "en": "let's make sure that we can create new recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.56,
          "end": 10.92,
          "en": "and that we can edit the existing ones.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.92,
          "end": 14.19,
          "en": "So for this, we need a new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 16.26,
          "en": "So let's generate this first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.26,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "I'll use the CLI again with ng g c,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "and I want to store it in the recipes folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 27.66,
          "en": "And here I will name it recipe-edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.66,
          "end": 30.21,
          "en": "And I don't want to create this spec file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.21,
          "end": 32.49,
          "en": "which is why I set it to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 35.31,
          "en": "So with this, if I shrink down the other files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.31,
          "end": 38.34,
          "en": "we get this new recipe-edit folder here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.34,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "with the RecipeEditComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 43.29,
          "en": "We'll work on the content of this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.29,
          "end": 45.12,
          "en": "after the form section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.12,
          "end": 47.28,
          "en": "but I already want to load it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.28,
          "end": 49.8,
          "en": "and I want to retrieve the route perimeter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.8,
          "end": 53.04,
          "en": "So to load this, what I will do is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.04,
          "end": 56.94,
          "en": "I will go to my app-routing.module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.94,
          "end": 59.673,
          "en": "and I will register a new route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.57,
          "end": 64.74,
          "en": "The first route is for a new recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 66.96,
          "en": "So maybe \"new\" would be a good path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.96,
          "end": 70.8,
          "en": "so that we have /recipes/new in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.8,
          "end": 75.543,
          "en": "And with that, we could load our RecipeEditComponent here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.84,
          "en": "And of course, you need to add the import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 83.34,
          "en": "from the newly created recipes/recipe-edit folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.34,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "Also, make sure that it was added to the app-module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "And this is done automatically as always by the CLI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 90.66,
          "en": "but you need to ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.66,
          "end": 92.64,
          "en": "that it is added to declarations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "and as an import here at the top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "to have it work correctly and to be able to load it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 103.75999999999999,
          "en": "So with that added here, we have our new recipe route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.64,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "Now I'll duplicate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 111.41,
          "en": "to also have a :id/edit route maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.84,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "so that we have the ID available in this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 116.46000000000001,
          "en": "because we need to load it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.46000000000001,
          "end": 118.53,
          "en": "But I want to have a /edit at the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.53,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "so that it's clear that we're in edit mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 122.7,
          "en": "And this is the same component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.7,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "that's also the RecipeEditComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.46,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "I will, in the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 131.1,
          "en": "determine whether we are in edit mode or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "Now with this setup here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 135.03,
          "en": "if we go back to the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.03,
          "end": 138.09,
          "en": "and we enter /edit after this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.09,
          "end": 140.19,
          "en": "we see \"recipe-edit works!\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.19,
          "end": 141.87,
          "en": "So that's great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.87,
          "end": 145.07999999999998,
          "en": "But we will see something maybe unexpected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.07999999999998,
          "end": 148.263,
          "en": "if I try to go to /recipes/new.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.7,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "Now we try to load the detail component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "and therefore we get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 157.56,
          "en": "because it basically failed to get a recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 159,
          "en": "with the ID \"new\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159,
          "end": 161.82,
          "en": "And that's exactly what went wrong here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 165.36,
          "en": "If we visit recipes/new,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.36,
          "end": 168.51,
          "en": "due to the way how we ordered our routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.51,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "it'll try to parse \"new\" as an ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 175.41,
          "en": "because the route with the dynamic ID parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 175.41,
          "end": 177.39,
          "en": "comes before the route definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.39,
          "end": 180.78,
          "en": "where we have \"new\" hard coded into the path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 183.18,
          "en": "So we should switch these two routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.18,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "so that the new route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 187.77,
          "en": "comes before the route with the dynamic parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 187.77,
          "end": 190.17,
          "en": "Otherwise, how would Angular know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.17,
          "end": 193.65,
          "en": "if whatever we pass right now should be interpreted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.65,
          "end": 198.65,
          "en": "as the new hard coded path or as dynamic parameter?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.72,
          "end": 200.79,
          "en": "So with this order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.79,
          "end": 203.13,
          "en": "now we should be able to load \"new\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.13,
          "end": 204.57,
          "en": "without any issues.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.57,
          "end": 206.67000000000002,
          "en": "If we hit Enter, that looks all right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.67000000000002,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "and we can also still load the existing recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.12,
          "end": 213.51,
          "en": "So with that, these paths are set up too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.51,
          "end": 216.93,
          "en": "The missing piece is now to retrieve the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.93,
          "end": 218.82,
          "en": "in the RecipeEditComponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 222.363,
          "en": "and to determine whether we are in edit mode or not.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
